NetHack scores can be broken down into four components: killing 
monsters, collecting treasure, exploring the dungeon, and esoteric 
actions like oiling squeaky boards.

I've modified Aardvark's extended logfile patch to calculate these 
components of your score and record them separately in xlogfile.

First apply Aardvark's Extended logfile patch - version 3
http://bernoulli.atspace.com/nethack/index.html

Then patch with this:
http://michael.floatingeye.net/nethack/xlogscore343.diff

Aardvark, if you would like to include this in some future version of 
your patch, feel free to make any modifications you see fit.


